00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:13.698
documented revenue growth can overcome rotation pressure in a rate-sensitive sector once

00:04:13.698 --> 00:04:16.358
the latest central bank commentary is digested.

00:04:16.898 --> 00:04:21.578
Granite owns and manages logistics warehouses and industrial properties in North America

00:04:21.578 --> 00:04:26.778
and Western Europe, with contractual annual rent escalations that feed cash flow growth,

00:04:26.778 --> 00:04:29.518
