00:05:07.699 --> 00:05:12.619
Invalidation is a close below the 50 session average on volume above the 20 session average

00:05:12.619 --> 00:05:13.659
inside that window.

00:05:14.179 --> 00:05:17.679
That is the line that kills the thesis, not a hunch after the fact.

00:05:18.159 --> 00:05:23.639
Confidence is low because it is one fundamental factor against unresolved inflation data, and

00:05:23.639 --> 00:05:28.199
And the valuation discipline lesson from that Canadian bank hold is why this stays a watch.

00:05:28.739 --> 00:05:33.379
